---
Title: Abhisamayamañjarī
Author: Śākyarakṣita
Dhīḥ 1992, vol. 12: 123–54
---

[ed. p. 123]
oṁ namo vajravārāhyai


namo stu vajrayoginyai śūnyatākaruṇātmane |
bibarti mūrtivaicitryaṃ yo jagadbhāvabhedataḥ ||


yā saṃbodhisudhāsudhāvanavaśād vaiśadyavidyotitā
śāntādyā tanute vineyajanatā rāgād bahiḥ śoṇatā |
bibhrāṇā kuliśaṃ kapālam amalaṃ khaṭvāṅgam ugradyuti 
seyaṃ vajravilāsinī bhagavatī bhūyād vibhūtyai tava ||


iha gurubuddhayor abhinnaśraddhaḥ sugṛhītabodhicittaḥ samyagāsāditābhiṣeko muktakuntalakalāpaḥ pañcavaṭikādiprayogapariśodhitavaktro yogī kvacit śmaśānaparvatādideśe sukhāsanopaviṣṭaḥ sākṣāc chavopaviṣṭo vā oṁ a ā i ī u ū ṛ ṝ ḷ ḹ e ai o au aṁ aḥ ka kha ga gha ṅa ca cha ja jha ña ṭa ṭha ḍa ḍha ṇa ta tha da dha na pa pha ba bha ma ya ra la va śa ṣa sa ha kṣa huṁ huṁ phaṭ — ity ālikālipaṅktisphuratpañcaraśmikāṃ trir uccārya pariveṣya sthitāṃ sphurat tricakradevatāvṛndamarditavighnavṛndāṃ bhāvayet | iti vāgviśuddhiḥ |

viśuddhiskandhādisamutthaṃ pūjādikaṃ bodheḥ śīghrakāraṇaṃ bhavatīti skandhādiviśuddhim adhimuñcet | tatra rūpādiṣu vijñānaparyanteṣu phenabudbudamarīcikadalīmāyopamatvena niśceyā vairocanādayaḥ | tathāyām akṣobhyaḥ | yad vā vairocanādidevatādhimokṣa eva leṣāṃ viśuddhiḥ | daśadiglokadhātusthā vīrayoginyākarṣayet | [ed. p. 126] oṁ yogaśuddāḥ sarvadharmā yogaśuddho 'ham | oṁ āḥ aralli hoḥ jaḥ huṃ vaṃ ho vajraḍākinī samayas tvaṃ dṛśya hoḥ vajrāñjalyā ūrdhvavikacamudrayā baliṃ dadyāt niśārdhake | oṁ kha kha khāhi khāhi sarvayakṣarākṣasabhūtapretapiśāconmādā[psmā]raḍākaḍākinyādaya imaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇantu samayaṃ rakṣantu bhujarthaṃ pibarthaṃ jighrarthaṃ mātikramatha mama sarvākārajñatayā sarvasukhavivṛddhaye sahāyakā bhavantu huṃ huṃ phaṭ phaṭ svāhā | balimantraviśuddhiḥ | 

tatra rūpavedanāsaṃjñāsaṃskāravijñāneṣu vairocanaratnasambhavāmitābhāmoghasiddhivajrasattvāḥ | rūpāditathatāyām akṣobhyaḥ | sitapītaraktaharitaśuklakṛṣṇāḥ ṣaḍ ete varṇato boddhavyāḥ | vairocanaḥ cakrodyatadakṣiṇakaro ghaṇṭāyutasagarbhakaṭisthavāmakaraḥ | ratnasaṃbhavāmitābhāmoghasiddhayo ratnaraktapadmaviśvavajrodyatasalīladakṣiṇabhujā ghaṇṭākaṭisthavāmakarāḥ | vajrasattvo vajradhārī salīlahṛdgatadakṣiṇakaraḥ, ghaṇṭāyutasagarbhakaṭisthavāmakaraḥ | akṣobhyavajraḥ savajrabhūsparśamudrānvitadakṣiṇakaraḥ, ghaṇṭānvitasagarbhakaṭisthavāmakaraḥ | cakṣuḥśrotraghrāṇavaktrasparśeṣu mohavajradveṣavajraīrṣyāvajrarāgavajramātsaryavajrāḥ, kṣitigarbhavajrapāṇikhagarbhalokeśvarasarvanīvaraṇaviṣkambhīnāmāntarāḥ, śuklakṛṣṇapītaraktaśyāmavarṇāḥ | sarvāyataneṣv aiśvaryavajraḥ samantabhadranāmāntaraḥ śuklaḥ | mohavajraś cakrodyatadakṣiṇakaraḥ, salīlaghaṇṭānvitahṛdgatavāmakaraḥ | dveṣavajraḥ savajrahṛdgatadakṣiṇakaraḥ, ghaṇṭānvitasagarbhakaṭisthavāmakaraḥ | īrṣyāvajrarāgavajramātsaryavajrāḥ kramaśo ratnaraktapadmaviśvavajrodyatasalīladakṣiṇabhujāḥ, ghaṇṭānvitasalīlahṛdgatavāmakarāḥ | aiśvaryavajras tu savajrahṛdgatadakṣiṇakaraḥ, ghaṭānvitasagarbhakaṭisthavāmakaraḥ | tatra [ed. p. 127] mohavināśanād mohavajraḥ, dveṣadveṣanād dveṣavajraḥ, īryṣāsarvāsaṅgamātsaryavināśād īrṣyāvajrādayas trayaḥ | sarvaiśvaryadānād aiśvaryavajraḥ, [ete] pṛthivyaptejovāyudhātuviśuddhasvabhāvāḥ |

pātinī-maraṇī-ākarṣaṇīnarteśvaryaḥ pītakṛṣṇaraktaharitavarṇā ekavaktrāś caturbhujāḥ | cakrakarti-vajrakarti-padmakarti-khaḍgakartidhāridakṣiṇabhujadvayāḥ, kapālakhaṭvāṅgadhārivāmabhujadvyayāḥ | locanā-māmakī-pāṇḍarā-tārākhyā ākāśadhātusvabhāvāḥ | padmajālino dhūmravarṇādhūmraśuklaraktatrimukhā ṣaḍbhujā kapālakhaṭvāṅgapāśadhārivāmabhujatrayā, aṅkuśabrahmamuṇḍakartibhūṣitadakṣiṇabhujatrayā, dharmadhātuvajrasvabhāvā | tatra pātanyādayo nāmānurūpakarmaprasādhikāḥ | vairocanādaya ālīḍhapadā jaṭāmukuṭinas trinetrāḥ pañcamudriṇaḥ | devyo muktakeśyo nagnā ālīḍhapadās trinetrāḥ pañcamudrāḥ |

tataḥ svahṛdante śuṣire raṃkārabījanirjātaravimaṇḍalastharaktavaṃkāraṃ dṛṣṭvā tatkiraṇair antaḥ kalmaṣam āpasya pratiromavivaravinirgatair vakṣyamāṇaṃ bhagavatīmaṇḍalacakraṃ gurubuddhabodhisattvāṃś caākṛṣyānīya nabhasi purato vibhāvya vanditvā bījaraśmivisphāritavīṇādiṣoḍaśadevībhir arcayet | tatra vīṇā vaṃśā mṛdaṅgā murajā ekavaktrāś caturbhujā nīlapītaraktaharitāḥ svasvavādyavādanatatparāḥ pradhānabhujadvayā, vajravajraghaṇṭādharāparabhujadvayāḥ | hāsyā lāsyā gītā nṛtyā ekamukhāś caturbhujā aruṇanīlapītaharitāḥ | hasyā lāsyābhinaye pradhānakaradvayā | lāsyā vajravajraghaṇṭādhārisagarbhalāsyābhinayapradhānabhujadvayā | gītā kaṃsīkādhāri[ed. p. 128]pradhānabhujadvayā | nṛtyā kamalābhinayapradhānabhujadvayā | āsām anyadakṣiṇetarabhujayoḥ kapālakhaṭvāṅāḥ | puṣpā dhūpā dīpā gandhā śvetadhūmradīpaśikhābharaktavarṇāḥ, caturbhujaikavaktrāḥ | āsāṃ pradhānaikabhuje puṣpadhūpakaṭacchudīpayaṣṭigandhaśaṅkhadharāḥ, itarabhujatrayeṣu ḍamarukapālakhaṭvāṅgāni | ādarśā rasā sparśā dharmā śvetaraktaharitadhavalāś caturbhujaikamukhāḥ pradhānaikabhujena darpaṇarasapātraviśvavajradharmodayadharāḥ, itarabhujatrayeṣu ḍamarukapālakhaṭvāṅgāni | 

tadanu vakṣyamāṇāṣṭapadamantrair abhistutya pāpadeśanā-puṇyānumodanā-nirvāṇakāmanā(°kāma MS)-jinacirasthiti-arthādhyeṣaṇā-dharmacakrapravṛttyarthabuddhayācanā-svapuṇyapariṇāmanā ceti saptavidhānuttarapūjāṃ kṛtvā ratnatrayaśaraṇagamana-jinamārgāśrayaṇa-ātmabhāvaniryātana-bodhicittotpādapuraḥsaraṃ sarvasattvānām ekaputravat tathaivaikarasamahāsukhasaṃyojanāṃ vāñchātmikāṃ maitrīm, duḥkhoddharaṇakāmanākārāṃ (°kāmenā° MS) karuṇām, utpannakuśalamūlabhogaiśvaryādiṣv aviyogeccāsvabhāvāṃ muditām, sarvatra pratighānunayarahitadharmatāyāṃ svarasavāhitayā (°yo MS) pravṛttilakṣaṇām upekṣāṃ ca bhāvayitvopārjitapuṇyasaṃbhāro jñānasaṃbhārābhivṛddhaye oṁ svabhāvaśuddhāḥ sarvadharmāḥ svabhāvaśuddho 'ham ity arthābhimukhīkaraṇapūrvakaṃ paṭhet |


atra svabhāvaśuddhāḥ sarvadharmā iti grāhyaviśuddhiḥ, svabhāvaśuddho ham iti grāhakaviśuddhiḥ.

	māyāṃ vidhāya māyāvī yadā saṃharate punaḥ |
	na (nā MS) kiñcid vidyate tatra dharmāṇāṃ sā hi dharmatā ||

[ed. p. 129] iti pravacanāt | traidhātukam āmantritamaṇḍalacakraṃ ca pratibhāsamātrasvbhāvaṃ prabhāsvara eva praveśya, ātmānaṃ ca ravau, taṃ vaṃkāre, tam ardhacandre (°ndraṃ MS), taṃ bindau, taṃ nāde, tad vikalpam api oṁ śūnyatājñānavajrasvabhāvātmako 'ham ity arthānusmaraṇenoccārya (ṇoccārya MS) tyajet | śūnyatājñānam evābhedyatvād vajram, tasya svabhāvas tadātmako 'ham ity arthaḥ | tataḥ pūrvapraṇidhānāvedhavaśāt śūnyatāsamādher vyutthāya (dhe vyutthāya MS) svacittam evopary upari yaṃ raṃ vaṃ laṃ pariṇatadhanustrikoṇavartulacaturasrākāranīlaraktaśvetapītavarṇacalatpatākāṅkakoṭidvayajvālākaṃ ghaṇṭākaṃ koṇacatuṣṭayaṃ vāyuvahnivaruṇakṣitimaṇḍalasvabhāvaṃ vicintya tad upari suṃkrārasamudbhavaṃ caturasram aṣṭaśṛṅgo (ṅga MS) pūrvadakṣiṇapaścimottarapārśveṣu rūpyavaiḍūryasphaṭikasuvarṇamayaṃ sumeruṃ dhyātvā tataḥ oṁ sumbha nisumbha hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa huṃ hūṃ phaṭ | oṁ gṛhṇāpaya 2 huṃ hūṃ phaṭ | oṃ ānaya ho bhagavan vidyārāja huṃ hūṃ phaṭ | iti caturo mantrān vāmatarjanyaṅguṣṭhe choṭikādānapūrvakam utsārya kṛṣṇaharitaraktapītavarṇān brahmāṇḍarasātalavyāpijvalanmahākāyān pūrvottarapaścimadakṣiṇāsu dikṣu krameṇa sumbhādimantraraśmibhir yāvad icchāvistarān caturo vajraprākārān oṁ vajraprākāra hūṃ vaṃ hüṃ ity uccārya niveśayet | tatsamakālam eva huṃkārajatadadhiṣṭhitaviśvavajreṇa oṃ medinī vajībhava vajrabandha huṃ iti paṭhitvā viśvavajramayīṃ bhūmim ā rasatalaparyantām adhitiṣṭhet |

tataḥ vajraraśmi oṃ vajraśarajvala traṃ saṃ traṃ ity abhidhāya pañcaśūkavajrākāram atinibiḍam upari śarajālam, tasyādho vajrapañjara hūṃ vaṃ hūṃ ity uccārya vajrapañjaram, oṃ vajravitāna hūṃ khaṃ hūṃ ity uccārya yathāsthānaṃ vajravitānam, oṃ [ed. p. 130] vajrajvālānalārka hūṃ hūṃ hūṃ ity uktvā vajrajvālāṃ ca cintayet | tad anu sumbhādimantracatuṣṭaye niṣpannāḥ kākāsyādicatasro devīs tad evobhayamantraraśmisaṃbhūtā yamadāḍhyādicatasro devīś cintayet | etā dvibhujā ekavaktrā nābher adhaḥ śūlākārā dakṣiṇe vajramudgaradhāriṇyo vāme ātmarūpakīlakahastāḥ (°hasto MS) spharaṇayogena gatvā daśadiggatavighnavṛndamānīya dīrghanādoccāritahuṃkāraniṣpanneṣu vajraprākārabāhyeṣu samīpe digvidikṣu (vidigastu MS) kūpeṣu praveśya oṃ gha gha ghāṭaya ghāṭaya sarvaduṣṭān phaṭ phaṭ kīlaya kīlaya sarvapāpān phaṭ phaṭ hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ vajraṃ kīlaya vajradhara ājñāpayati sarvavighnān kāyavākcittavajrakīlaya kīlaya huṃ phaṭ, iti kīlanamantroccāraṇapūrvakaṃ kīlayanti | oṃ vajramudgaravajrakīlam ākoṭaya huṃ phaṭ ity ākoṭanamantroccāraṇapūrvakam ākoṭayanti | ākoṭanakīlanābhyāṃ vighnavṛndamahāsukhena tathaikarūpaṃ kurvantīṃ bhāvayet |

punaḥ śeṣavighān utsārya prākāreṣu līyamānāsu tāsu toye toyāspharaṇabindunirgamanyāyena sīmābandhārthaṃ vartulān vajrapadmacakraprākārān cintayet | tad eva vajraprākārādivighnotsāraṇaviśuddhyā niḥsandhyaikakhaṇḍībhūtaṃ nirvighnaṃ ca jagad adhimuñcya vajrapañjaramadhye dharmadhātusvabhāvāṃ dharmodayām ekārām upariviśālām adhaḥ sūkṣmāṃ vicintya tanmadhye viśvābjaviśvavajrasthahuṃjasavidyāvairocanātmakaṃ kūṭāgāraṃ tathāgatapṛthagjanayos tathataikarūpatvena vaidharmyā (°rmyo MS) 'bhāvāc caturasraṃ smṛtyupasthānaṃ samyakprahāṇaṃ ṛddhipādam indriyaviśuddhyā caturdvāram, aṣṭāṅgamārgaviśuddhyā aṣṭastambhopaśobhitaṃ (°tāṃ MS) śūraṅgamagaganagañjavimalamudrasiṃhavikrīḍitasamādhicatuṣṭayaviśuddhyā [ed. p. 131 - began viśuddhyā] hārārdhahāracandrārkapatākādarśacāmaravibhūṣitam, saṃkṣepeṇa tattadbuddhaguṇaviśuddhyā (tattu MS) tallakṣaṇopetam | 

tasya nābhau aṣṭalokadharmatām upalakṣayed viśuddhyā raktapaṃkārajāṣṭadalakamalakarṇikāyām avidyāndhakāravidhamanaviśuddhyā sūryamaṇḍale dviguṇālipariṇatā darśajñānasvabhāvacandramaṇḍalaṃ ḍa ḍha da dha ya lopetadviguṇakālipariṇatasamatājñānasvabhāvasūryamaṇḍalayor melāpakamahāsukhaṃ saṃpuṭamadhyaraktavaṃkārajavajramuṣṭyantargatabhānusthavaṃbījaṃ pratyavekṣaṇājñānasvabhāvaṃ tannirmitaraśminā spharitvā daśadikṣu bhagavaty ākāreṇa sattvārthaṃ kṛtvā punas tatraiva saṃharaṇaṃ kṛtyānuṣṭhānajñānam | etat sarvapariṇāmenātmānaṃ bhagavatīṃ vajravārāhīṃ suviśuddhadharmadhātujñānasvabhāvaṃ mahārāgaviśuddhyā dāḍimīkusumasaṃkāśaṃ satyadvayaviśuddhyā bhujadvayoḥ, dakṣiṇena prasṛtordhvatarjanikayā duṣṭatarjanikayā (?) duṣṭatarjanapareṇa samarasībhūtapañcajñānaviśuddyāruṇavajradharāṃ vāmenādha ekaśūkordhvaṃ kṛṣṇapañcaśūkānvitadaṇḍānugataśuṣkaṃ sārdraśiro viśvavajrakanakakalaśamūlavinirgataraṇatsūkṣmaghaṇṭikānvitaviśvapatākāvirājitopāyasvabhāvabāhudaṇḍāsaktaśuklakhaṭvāṅgamahāsukhamahākaruṇārasamayāsṛkpūrṇakapālaṃ ca bibhratīṃ mithyā dṛṣṭiprahāṇā vikṛtaikānanāṃ caturmāravināśanād daṃṣtṛotkaṭabhīṣaṇāṃ kāyavākcittaviśuddhakṛpāraktanetratrayām | advaitatattvasya caturaśītisāhasradharmaskandhair vikiraṇaviśuddhyā muktakeśīṃ cakrikuṇḍalakaṇṭhikārucakrakhaṭvāṅgamekhalākhyapañcamudrādharām |

	kaṇṭhikārucakakuṇḍalāni śiromaṇivibhūṣitām |
	yajñopavītaṃ bhsameti mudrāṣaṭkaṃ prakīrtitam ||

iti kecit | maṇḍalanāyikātvena ṣaṇmudritām ity eke | digambarāṃ navayauvanaśālinīm (°nī MS) ālikālipañcāśadakṣarasvabhāvāṃ granthitasārdranaraśiromālinīṃ śūnyatālīḍhajagacsūcakatvena vāmapādenākuñcyadakṣiṇaṃ pañcavitastiprasāraṇādālīḍhenākrāntaraktāṣṭapatrapadmasthasūryamaṇḍalopari patitaśāśvatocchedavikalpasvabhāvabhairavakālarātrīm, suviśuddhajñānālokayogāt sūryaprabhāmaṇḍalinīm, śūnyatārūpatayā jagadanulambhasāmyān mahātejasam, rajoyogāt sravantīṃ karakalitakapālagaladasṛkpānaprasaṅgādrudhirapriyāṃ vajrāvalīdvayamadhyākṛtapañcatathāgatātmakakapālamālābaddhatriśikhāṃ viśvānugrāhakatvena viśvavajrākrāntamaulīṃ sarvalokadhātusaṃgrāhaktvena cakṣuḥśrotraghrāṇajihvākāyamanaālayakliṣṭamanovijñānam ity aṣṭavijñānāṃ nairātmyāsvarūpatvena śmaśānāṣṭakamadhyavartinīṃ bhāvayet |

yat tu lüyīpādābhisamaye rakṣāvajrapañjarāder anantaraṃ śūnyatābhāvanoktā, tad adhimātraprajñādhikārāt | tasya śūnyataiva paraṃ rakṣeti | sarvajanasaṃgrahaṇaiḥ punar atra śūnyatābhāvanānantaraṃ rakṣāpañjarādikam uktam, bahuṣu cābhisamayeṣv iyam evānupūrvī dṛśyata iti | pūrvādidaleṣu caturṣu vāmāvartena yathākramaṃ ḍākinī-lāmā-khaṇḍarohā-rūpiṇyaḥ | kṛṣṇaśyāmaraktagaurā ekavaktrāś caturbhujā vāme khaṭvāṅgakapāladharāḥ | dakṣiṇe ḍamarukartidhāriṇyas trinetrā daṃṣṭrākarālavadanā muktakeśyo nagnā ālīḍhapadāḥ pañcamudrādharā galanmuṇḍamālinyo vajramālāṅkalalāṭamekhalāḥ sarāvaghuṃghurādivibhūṣitā bhāvanīyāḥ | āgneyādividigdaleṣu dakṣiṇāvartena bodhicittena rajasā pañcāmṛtaiḥ pañcapradīpaiḥ [ed. p 133 - begins mṛtībhūtaiḥ] siddharasavad amṛtībhūtaiḥ paripūrṇāni catvāri padmabhājanāni bhāvyāni |

tadbahirnīlavajrāvalīvalayitanīlāṣṭāraprathamacittacakrasya pūṛvottarapaścimadakṣiṇāreṣu pullīramalaya-jālandhara-oḍiyānārbudapīṭhasvabhāveṣu pracaṇḍācaṇḍākṣīprabhāvatīmahānāsāḥ | āgneyanairṛtivāyavyaiśāneṣu godāvarī-rāmeśvara-devīkoṭṭa-mālava-pīṭhātmakeṣūpapīṭheṣu vīramatī-kharvarī-laṅkeśvarī-drumacchāyāḥ | raktapadmāvalīparivṛtaraktāṣṭāradvitīyavākcakrasya pūrvottarārayoḥ kāmarūpauḍrakṣetrayor airāvatī mahābhairavā, paścimadakṣiṇayos triśakuni-kośalopakṣetrātmanor vāyuvegā surābhakṣī | āgneyanairṛtyayoḥ kaliṅgalampākachandohayoḥ śyāmādevī subhadrā | vāyavyaiśānayoḥ kāñcīhimālayopachandohayor hayakarṇā khagānanā | śuklacakrāvalīpariveṣṭitaśuklāṣṭāratṛtīyakāyacakrasya pūrvottarārayoḥ pretapurīgṛhadevatāmelāpakayoś cakravegā khaṇḍarohā | paścimadakṣiṇayoḥ saurāṣṭrasuvarṇadvīpopamelāpakayoḥ śauṇḍinīcakravarmiṇyau | āgneyanairṛtyayor nagarasindhuśmaśānayor marukulūtayor upaśmaśānayoś cakravartinī mahāvīryā | etāś ca pracaṇḍādidevya ekavaktrā dvibhujāḥ, vāmena raktapūrṇakapālaṃ dakṣiṇe duṣṭatarjanakartikāṃ bibhartyaḥ | aparaṃ veśābharaṇādikaṃ ḍākinyādivad āsām | 

dvāre kākāsyā-ulūkāsyā-śvānāsyā-śūkarāsyā ḍākniyādivat | mukhāni param āsāṃ nāmānugatāni | koṇeṣu yamadāḍhī-yamadūtī-yamadaṃṣṭriṇī-yamamathanyo mānuṣīmukhāḥ savyetaradigdevyaḥ savyetarakāyārdhasadṛśaśarīrārdhāḥ | śavāsanās tv aṣṭāv apīmāḥ | pariśiṣṭaveśādikaṃ ḍākinyādivad eva | sarvāś ca tā devyo bhagavatīniṣpattisamakālam eva jhaṭiti niṣpannā draṣṭavyāḥ |

[ed. p. 134] tataḥ kavacadvayaṃ kṛtvā jñānacakravibhāvanam iti lūyīpādoktarakṣākavacaṃ kuryāt | bhrūṁ hūṁ khaṃ aḥ hāṁ hakārair āyatanāni saṃśodhya vārāhī-yāminī-mohanī-sañcāriṇī-saṃtrāsinī-caṇḍikānāṃ ṣaḍdevīnāṃ mantraiḥ svasvadevatāvan nairātmyena kvacayet | oṁ vaṃ nābhau | hāṃ yāṃ hṛdi | hrīṃ moṃ vaktre | heṃ hīṃ mūrdhni | hūṃ hūṁ śikhāyām | phaṭ phaṭ sarvāṅeṣv astre | athavā mantradevatayor abhedāt tattanmanasi niṣpannās teṣu teṣu sthāneṣu tattatdevatā eva bhāvyāḥ | 

tatra vārāhī raktanīlaharitamukhī vāme kapālakhaṭvāṅgapāśān, dakṣiṇe 'ṅguśabrahmamuṇḍakartīḥ bibhrāṇā | yāminī-mohanī-sañcāriṇī-saṃtrāsinī-caṇḍikā nīlasitapītaharitadhūmravarṇāś caturbhujāḥ sakapālakhaṭvāṅgaghaṇṭāś ca vāme, dakṣiṇe ḍamarukartikā dadhānāḥ | sarvāś ca muktakeśyo nagnās trinetrā ālīḍhāsanasthā draṣṭavyāḥ |

tadanu lalāṭakaṇṭhahṛdayeṣu oṁ āḥ hūṁ ity akṣarāṇi śuklaraktanīlāni niveśayet | tato hṛnmadhyavartiraktāśṭadalapadmasthitabhānumaṇḍalopari raktavajravaraṭakāntargataravisthaṃ vaṃbījaraśmir daśadigvarti sarvaṃ vīravīreśvarī pariṇatarūpaṃ jñānacakraṃ jaḥkāreṇākṛṣya tannirgatavīṇādiṣoḍaśadevībhir arghādipuraḥsaraṃ pūjayitvā pheṃkārapāṭhapūrvakaṃ jālāmudrāṃ baddhvā lalāṭe vāmāvartena bhrāmayet | hūṁkāreṇa svasamayacakre jale jalam iva praveśya vaṃkāreṇa bandhayitvā hoḥkāreṇa saṃtoṣya oṁ yogaśuddhāḥ sarvadharmā yogaśuddho ham iti paṭhet | jñānacakrākarṣaṇasamakālam evākṛṣṭābhir vajravilāsinībhir jñānāmṛtapūrṇakapālaḍamarudhāriṇībhir hṛdbījanirgatavīṇādidevīpūjitābhiḥ—

	[ed. p. 135] yathā hi jātamātreṇa snāpitāḥ sarvatathāgatāḥ |
	tathāhaṃ snāpayiṣyāmi śuddhaṃ divyena vāriṇā ||

iti paṭhantībhir īṣadāvarjitavāmakarakapālodbhūtajñānāmṛtadhārābhir abhiṣicyamānamahāsukhātmānaṃ vicintya śeṣāmbuniṣpannān tathāgatān śirasi vibhāvya oṁ sarvatathāgatābhiṣekataḥ samayaśriye hūṁ ity adhitiṣṭhet | 

tatra bhagavatyāḥ kuleśaḥ śirasi vairocanaḥ, ḍākinyādīnāṃ ratnasaṃbhavaḥ, cittavākkāyacakragatānāṃ yathāsaṃkhyam akṣobhyāmitābhaśāśvatāḥ, samayacakrasthānām amoghasiddhiḥ | paścād amṛtāsvādanaṃ kuryāt | yaṃkāreṇa vāyumaṇḍalaṃ tad upari raṃkārajāgnimaṇḍalaṃ tatra śuklaāḥkārajaṃ śuklapadmabhājanaṃ muṇḍatrayakṛtacūlikāvasthitas tatra oṁ traṃ aṃ khaṃ hūṁ lāṃ māṃ pāṃ tāṃ kārajatadadhiṣṭhitapañcāmṛtapañcapradīpān niśpādya vāyupreritajvalitāgnitāpavilīnabījākṣarādikam abhinavabhānuvarṇadravarūpam avalokya tad upari vitastimātram atikramya śuklahūṁbhavādhomukhāmṛtamaye śuklakhaṭvāṅgaṃ dṛṣtvā tasminn api tadbāṣpasparśāt tatrāvilīya patitena tad drava pārad avarṇaṃ śītalaṃ vicintya punas tadupari tryakṣaram upary upari dṛṣtvā tadraśmibhis trailokyodaravartisarvāmṛtena sārdham aśeṣatathāgatahṛdayavartijñānāmṛtam ākṛṣya tatraivāntarbhāvya kramaśas tryakṣareṇāpi vilīnaiḥ punas tryakṣareṇādhiṣṭhāyātmānaṃ māṇḍaleyaṃ devīnāṃ jihvāyāṃ śuklahūṃkārajayavaphalapramāṇaṃ śuklavajraṃ dhyātvā tadraśminalikābhiḥ prāśanāṃ kuryāt | tato vakṣyamāṇāṣṭapadārcanamantraiḥ stūyāt | yady etāvatī mahati maṇḍalacakracittaṃ cirataraṃ shirīkartum asamarthaḥ, tadā nābhikamalastharavisomasampuṭāntargatavaṃbījamṛṇālodbhūtaraśmirekhāyāṃ [ed. p. 136] cittasthirīkaraṇadvāreṇa prāṇāpānayor nāḍīdvayavāhaparihārān madhyamāpraveśe jvalitayoś cāṇḍālyā drāvitasya śiraḥ śaśicakravyāptikrameṇānandādibhedāt sahajodaye sakalavikalpasaṃhārāt sakṛd vā maṇḍalacakrasyānupalambhaḥ, krameṇa vā śūnyatāntarbhāvaḥ |

tatrāyaṃ kramaḥ — jagat śmaśāneṣu, śmaśānāni bāhyacakre, bāhyacakraṃ kāyacakre, kāyacakraṃ vākcakre, vākcakreaṃ cittacakre, cittacakrasya diggatā ḍākinyādiṣu, vidiggatā rūpiṇyādiṣu, ḍākinyādayaś ca mahāsukhacakragatā bhagavatīmukhe, bhagavatyāsanāmbhojaṃ bhānau, bhānuṃ bhairave, bhairavaṃ kālarātryām, kālarātriṃ khaṭvāṅge, khaṭvāṅgaṃ bhagavatyām, bhagavatīṃ nābhikamale, nābhikamalaṃ ravisomasaṃpuṭe, ravisomasaṃpuṭaṃ vaṃkāre, vaṃkāram arddhacandre, arddhacandraṃ bindau, binduṃ nāde 'ntarbhāvya nādam api vālāgraśatasahasrabhāgarūpaṃ paśyet | adhimātraṃ tu tam api nopalambhate (°bhyate MS) | evaṃ jñānacakrasvabhāvatayāpi bhagavatyāḥ prabhāsvare praveśaḥ | evaṃ bhūyo bhūyaḥ praviśed uttiṣṭhet | 

	śvāsavāto yathādarśe layaṃ gacchati sarvataḥ |
	bhūtakoṭiṃ tathā yogī praviśec ca muhur muhuḥ ||

punaḥ punaḥ praveśanaiś ca satyadvayābhinnaniṣpannaṃ yuganaddhasamādhiṃ yogī sākṣāt karotīti | khede sati nābhisarojasthavaṃbīje cittaṃ niveśya vakṣyamāṇahṛdayopahṛdayayor yathābhilāṣam anyatarasyoccāraṇasamayam eva tadbījanādān nirgatavāyunā saha pañcacakrāṇi saṃsphārya jagadarthaṃ kārayitvā vāyoḥ praveśasamaye mālāsūtrākarṣaṇanyāyena mantreṇa saha tasminn eva praveśayet | vakṣyamāṇapratyekadevīmantrajāpārthināṃ [ed. p. 137] tu pratyekadevīmantroccāraṇasamāptau pratyekaspharaṇasaṃharaṇa pūrvavat kartavyam | athavā tata eva pūrvavad uttiṣṭhantīm avadhūtīvartmanā mukhān niḥsṛtya padme svasthānaṃ gatvā tathaiva bhramantīm akṣaramālāṃ bhāvayet, hṛdayopahṛdayayor anyataraṃ vakṣyamāṇamālāmantraṃ vā japet | athavā tad eva bījaṃ pariveṣṭitāṃ dīpamālām iva mantramālām ālokayan adratamavilambitam asat saṃkalavarjitam iti jāpayet |

oṁ vajravairocanīye hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā | bhagavatyā hṛdayamantraḥ | oṁ vajravairocanīy svāhā | ity ayam api hṛdayamantraḥ | oṁ sarvabuddhaḍākinīye vajravarṇanīye hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā | upahṛdayamantraḥ | mahāprabhāvā ete mantrāḥ | oṁ namo bhagavatī vajravārāhi vaṁ huṃ hūṃ phaṭ | oṁ namaḥ āryāparājite tralokyamāte mahāvidyeśvari huṃ hūṃ phaṭ | oṁ namaḥ sarvabhūtabhayāvahe mahāvajre huṃ hūṃ phaṭ | oṁ namo vajrāsane ajite 'parājite vaśyaṃkari netrabhrāmaṇī huṃ hūṃ phaṭ | oṁ namaḥ śoṣaṇi roṣaṇi krodhakarāle huṃ hūṃ phaṭ | oṁ namaḥ santrāsini māraṇi prabhedani aparajāye hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ namo jaye vijaye jambhani stambhani mohani huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ namo vajravārāhi mahāyogeśvari khage huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | ayaṃ bhagavatyā aṣṭapadapūjāmantraḥ |

atha ca mālāmantro bhavati — oṁ vajravārāhi protaṅge protaṅge hana hana prāṇān kiṃkini khiṃkhini ghuna ghuna vajrahaste śoṣaya śoṣaya vajrakhaṭvāṅgakapāladhāriṇi mahāpiśitamāṃsāśini mānuṣāntraprāvṛte sānnidhye naraśiromālāgranthitadhāriṇi [ed. p. 138, began °dhāriṇi] sumbhanisumbhe hana hana prāṇān sarvapāpaṃ sattvānāṃ sarvapaśūnāṃ mahāmāṃsacchedani krodhamūrte daṃṣtrākarālini mahāmudre śrīherukadevasyāgramahiṣi sahasraśire sahasrabāhave śatasahasrānane jvalitatejase jvālāmukhi piṅgalalocane vajraśarīre vajrāsane mili mili timili timili he he ha ha huṁ hūṁ kha kha dhu dhu ru ru dhuru dhuru muru muru advaitamahāyogini paṭhitasiddhe draiṃ dhaṃ draiṃ dhaṃ graṃ he he ha ha bhīme hasa hasa vīre hā hā ho ho huṁ hūṁ trailokyavināśani śatasahasrakoṭitathāgataparivāre huṁ hūṁ phaṭ siharūpe khaḥ jagarūpe gaḥ trailokyopare mahāsamudramekhale grasa grasa huṁ hūṁ phaṭ vīrādvaite huṁ hūṁ hā hā mahāpaśumohani yogeśvari tvaṃ ḍākinī lokānāṃ vandanī sadyaḥ pratyayakāriṇī huṁ hūṁ phaṭ bhūtatrāsani mahāvīre paramasiddhe yogeśvari phaṭ huṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā |

mahāprabhāvo 'yaṃ mantraḥ paṭhitasiddhiḥ | somagrahe candramasaṃ paśyan tāvaj japed yāvac candro mukto bhavati | paścād yāvad āvartayati tāvat strīsahasrair anugamyate | bhāvanāpuraḥsaraṃ sakṛduccāraṇād ākarṣayati mārayati krūracetasām uccāṭanavidveṣastambhanaṃ ca kurute | śmaśānāṅgāraṃ sakṛjjaptaṃ gṛhe grāme nagare vā kṣipet, dāhaṃ darśayati | mayūrapicchakamākāśe bhrāmayet, punar upaśamayati | ityādi bahuprakāram asya sāmartham anyatroktam |

[ed. p. 139] oṁ ḍākinīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ, ḍākinyāḥ | oṁ lāme huṁ hūṁ phaṭ, lāmāyāḥ | oṁ khaṇḍarohe huṁ hūṁ phaṭ, khaṇḍarohāyāḥ | sārvakarmiko 'yaṃ mantraḥ | oṁ rūpiṇiye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ, rūpiṇyāḥ | atha pracaṇḍādīnāṃ mantrā bhavanti | oṁ pracaṇḍe huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ caṇḍākṣīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ prabhāvatīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ mahānāse huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ vīramatīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ kharvarīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ laṅkeśvarīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ dramacchāye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ airāvatīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ mahābhairavīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ vāyuvege huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ surābhakṣīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ śyāmādevīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ subhadre huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ hayakarṇe huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ khagānane huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ cakravege huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ khaṇḍarohe huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ śauṇḍinīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ cakravarmaṇīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ suvīre huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ mahābale huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ cakravartinīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ mahāvīrye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ kākāsye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ ulūkāsye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ śvānāsye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ śūkarāsye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ yamaḍāḍhīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ yamadūtīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ yamadaṃṣṭriṇīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | oṁ yamamathanīye huṁ hūṁ phaṭ | evaṃ tāval lüyīpādābhisamayakrameṇa |

vistarataḥ saptatriṃśadātmakaṃ devībhagavatyā maṇḍalacakraṃ tatraiva maṇḍalabhedānantaraṃ vajrāvalyām asmadgurubhir upadarśitaṃ likhyate | nāyikādayaḥ sarvā dvibhujāḥ, ḍākinyaś caturbhujāś catasraḥ | kākāsyādayaś ca vāmena kapālaṃ bāhvāsaktakhaṭvāṅgaṃ ca bibhrāṇāḥ, savyena ḍamarukam | aparaṃ sarvaṃ pūrvavat | athavā bhagavatī pītavarṇā nīlā vā, ḍākinyādayaś catasras tu pītāḥ | savyena ḍamarubhṛtaḥ (°t MS) | cittacakrasya yoginyaḥ sitāḥ savajratarjanīkasavyetarakarāḥ | vākcakrasya kṛṣṇāḥ sapadmatarjanīkasavyahastāḥ [ed. p. 140 - began °hastāḥ] (°hastoḥ MS) | kāyacakrasya raktāḥ savyena tarjanīkacakrabhṛtaḥ | kākāsyādayaḥ savyena ḍamaruṃ vāmena tarjanīkanaramuṇḍaṃ bibhratyaḥ | ḍākinyādīnāṃ kākāsyādīnāṃ ca vāmabāhau khaṭvāṅgam | etāś ca dvādaśārdhapaṅkena nṛtyantyaḥ | aparaṃ sarvaṃ pūrvavat | devatāhaṃkāratyāgāya sarvajñatālābhāya darśanāya ca ḍākinyādayaḥ saptatriṃśadbodhipākṣikadharmasvabhāvā veditavyāḥ |

tatra rūpaskandhaparijñānaprārambhalakṣaṇakāyānusmṛtyupasthānaṃ ḍākinī | vedanāskandhaparijñānaprārambhalakṣaṇavedanānusmṛtyupasthānaṃ lāmā | saṃjñāsaṃskāraskandhamāyārūpatvāc ca dhāraṇalakṣaṇadharmānusmṛtyupasthānaṃ khaṇḍarohā | vijñānaskandhasvarūpapravibhedalakṣaṇaviśuddhyā cittānusmṛtyupasthāna rūpiṇī | dharmaśravaṇābhilāṣātyantādaralakṣaṇachandaṛddhipādaḥ pracaṇḍā | vīryānavaratābhyāsā vīryaṛddhipādaś caṇḍākṣī | atyantavicāraṇā mīmāṃsāṛddhipādaḥ prabhāvatī | bodhisākṣātkaraṇāśayātiśayaś cittaṛddhipādo mahānāsā | satyaratnatrayakarmaphalābhisaṃpratyayas tattvāvadhāraṇaiśvaryādi śraddhendriyaṃ vīramatī | avaśyakartavyatāvadhāraṇaṃ vīryendriyaṃ kharvarī | avidyāpratipakṣāmuṣitasmaraṇādhipatyasmṛtīndriyaṃ laṅkeśvarī | cittāgrataiśvaryāt samādhīndriyaṃ drumacchāyā | heyopādeyāvadhāraṇaiśvaryāt prajñendriyam airāvatī | 

śraddhādīndriyāṇy eva prakarṣaparyantagamanād balāni | śraddhābalaṃ mahābhairavā | vīryabalaṃ vāyuvegā | smṛtibalaṃ surābhakṣī | samādhibalaṃ śyāmādevī | prajñābalaṃ subhadrā |

[ed. p. 141] samādhir eva saṃbodheḥ kāraṇam | samādhisaṃbodhyaṅgaṃ hayakarṇā | kauśīdyānavakāśo vīryasaṃbodhyaṅgaṃ khagānanā | kuśaleṣūtsāhaḥ prītisaṃbodhyaṅgaṃ cakravegā | kuśalakarmaṇi karmaṇyatā prasrabdhisaṃbodhyaṅgaṃ khaṇḍarohā | nairātmyasvarūpeṇāvadhāraṇā dharmapravicayasaṃbodhyaṅgaṃ śauṇḍinī | avismaraṇaśīlatā smṛtisaṃbodhyaṅgaṃ cakravarmiṇī | samādhāvamanasikāropekṣāsaṃbodhyaṅgaṃ suvīrā | aviparītārthapratipattiḥ samyagdṛṣṭimahābalā | ārabdhasatkṛtyāparityāgaḥ samyaksaṃkalpaś cakravartinī | sattvāvisaṃvādanavacanaṃ samyagvāg mahāvīryā | daśakuśalān atikramāt kṛtyaṃ samyakkarmāntaḥ kākāsyā | sattvāviheṭhanāyājīvanaṃ samyagājīva ulūkāsyā | kuśalārthaghaṭanaṃ samyagvyāyāmaḥ śvānāsyā | buddhavacanānusmaraṇaṃ samyaksmṛtiḥ śūkarāsyā | samyaksamādhir bhagavatī vajravārāhī | anutpannānāṃ kuśalānāṃ dharmāṇām utpādanaṃ yamadāḍhī | utpannānāṃ kuśalānāṃ dharmāṇāṃ saṃrakṣaṇaṃ yamadūtī | utpannānām akuśalānāṃ dharmāṇāṃ prahāṇaṃ uamadraṃṣṭriṇī | anutpannānām akuśalānāṃ dharmāṇām anutpādanāt samyakprahāṇaṃ yamamathanī ceti | 

pramuditāvimalāprabhākarī-arciṣmatī-abhimukhī-sudurjayā-dūraṅgamā-acalā-sādhumatī-dharmameghākhyadaśabhūmiviśuddhyā krameṇa pīṭhopapīṭhādirūpaṃ kāyamaṇḍalamadhyātmayoginā bhāvayitavyam | tad uktam —

	caturviṃśatibhedena pīṭhādy atra vyavasthitam |
	atas tadbhramaṇe naiva khedaḥ kāryo nu tāttvikaiḥ ||

	kṣīyante ghātavas teṣāṃ bhramaṇād bāhyayoginām |
	ato bāhyaṃ nirākṛtya sthātavyaṃ yoginīnaye || iti


[ed. p. 142] tatra puṃ jāṃ oṃ aṃ goṃ rāṃ deṃ māṃ kāṃ oṃ triṃ kauṃ kaṃ laṃ kāṃ hiṃ preṃ gṛṃ sauṃ suṃ naṃ siṃ maṃ kuṃ | pullīramalayaśirasi pracaṇḍā | jālandharaśikhāyāṃ caṇḍākṣī | oḍiyānadakṣiṇakarṇe prabhāvatī | arbudam astakapṛṣṭhe mahānāsā | pīṭham | godāvarīvāmakarṇe vīramatī | rāmeśvarabhrūmadhye karvarī | devīkoṭacakṣuṣor laṅkeśvarī | mālavaskandhadvaye drumacchāyā | upapīṭham | cittacakrasya khecarī | anayā svargagatānāṃ saṃgrahaḥ | 

kāmarūpakakṣayor airāvatī | oḍras tanuyugale mahāvhairavā | kṣetram | triśukaninābhau vāyuvegā | kauśalāsāgre surābhakṣī | upakṣetram | kaliṅgamukhe śyāmādevī | lampākakaṇṭhe subhadrā | chandohaḥ | kāñcīhṛdaye hayakarṇā | himālayameḍhre khagānā | upacchandohaḥ | vākcakre bhūcarī | anayā martyānāṃ saṃgrahaḥ |

pretapurīliṅge cakravegā | gṛhadevatāgude khaṇḍarohā | melāpakam | saurāṣṭra-ūrudvaye śauṇḍinī | suvarṇadvīpajaṅghāyāṃ cakravarmiṇī | upamelāpakam | naga-aṅgulīṣu suvīrā | sindhu-pādapṛṣṭhayor mahābalā | śmaśānam | maru-aṅguṣṭhayoś cakravartinī | kulatāyāṃ jānudvaye mahāvīryā | upaśmaśānam | kāyacakre pātālavāsinī | anayā pātālagatānāṃ saṃgrahaḥ |

atrāyam upadeśaḥ — puṃ jāṃ ityādi sarvaṃ śanusvāraṃ nirūpyatām | puṃkārādyakṣaraparigatāny araśūnyatācakrākārāṇi pīṭhādisthānāni śiraḥprabhṛtiṣu jhaṭiti draṣṭavyāni | teṣu pīṭhādiṣu tattatsthānagatā nāḍyas tattaddevatārūpeṇa pariṇamayy avyavasthitā bhāvyāḥ | yathā bāhyavṛkṣādi samīpasthā nadyastoyena poṣaṇaṃ [ed. p. 143] kurvanti, tadvad dehe 'pi nāḍyo nakhādīnāṃ poṣaṇaṃ kurvantīti samānatā | bāhye vajrapīṭhaṃ mahābodhisaṃjñakaṃ sthānaṃ nairañjanā ca nadī | dehe mahāsukhacakraṃ vajrapīṭham avadhūtī nirañjanā | vaktravāmadakṣiṇanāsāpuṭaṃ gudadvāreṣu krameṇa kākāsyādayo dvārapālyaḥ | savyāpasavyaśrotrasavyāpasavyanetreṣu yamadāḍhyādayaḥ | hṛllalāṭakaṇṭhanābhikarṇikāsu ḍākinyādayaś catasraḥ | iti saṃpūrṇaṃ kāyamaṇḍalaṃ muhur muhur dṛḍham adhimoktavyam |

tato baliṃ dadyāt | bhojyādikaṃ purataḥ saṃsthāpya prāguktakrameṇa viśodhya jālāmudrātanmātrābhyām ānītaṃ sarvākāraniṣpannaṃ maṇḍalacakraṃ purato 'vasthāpyārghādikapuraḥsaraṃ saṃpūjālikālipariṇatacandrasūryamaṇḍalasvabhāvakaradvayāntaragatahūṁkāraṃ dṛṣtvā oṁ anyonyānugatāḥ sarvadharmāḥ sphara sphara anupraviṣṭāḥ sarvadharmā antyantānupraviṣṭāḥ sarvadharmā hūṃ ity uccāraṇapūrvakaṃ candrasūryārūḍhahūṁkārapariṇāmena vajrāñjalikṛtakaratale tad amṛtabhāṇḍam avasthāpya dhyātvā vā abhimarasiddhyartham iti paṭhet —

	devyaḥ pramāṇasamayaṃ pramāṇaṃ taduktavācaś ca paraṃ pramāṇam |
	etena satyena bhaveyur etā devyo mamānugrahahetubhūtāḥ ||

tataḥ pūjyapūjakapūjādīnām abhedaṃ paśyan tadamṛtabhāṇḍaṃ dikṣu vāmāvartena pūrvāṃ diśam ārabhya, vidikṣu agnikoṇam ārabhya dakṣiṇāvartena bhrāmayan hūṁbhavaśuklavajrajihvāyātāṃ nāyikāṃ pratitricakradevatānāṃ svasvamantrair ekavāroccārite bhrāmayan oṁ aralli hoḥ jaḥ hūṁ vaṁ hoḥ vajraḍākinyaḥ samayas tvaṃ [ed. p. 144] dṛśya ho — ity anena ekadvitricatuḥpañcavāroccāritena ḍhaukayet | tata ācamanahastaprokṣaṇatāmbūlādikaṃ dattvā vīṇādibhiḥ saṃpūjya saṃstutya prārthayet —

	bhavaśamasamasaṅgā bhagnasaṃkalpabhaṅgī
	kham iva sakalabhāvaṃ bhāvato vīkṣamāṇāḥ |
	gurutarakaruṇāmbhaḥsphītacittāmbunāthāḥ 
	kuruta kuruta devyo mayy atīvānukampām ||

tato 'ṣṭaśmaśānasthitadikpālānāṃ pūrvavad bhrāmayan oṃ kha kha khāhi khāhi sarvayakṣarākṣasabhūtapretapiśāconmādāpasmāraḍākaḍākinyādaya imaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇantu samayaṃ rakṣantu mama sarvasiddhiṃ prayacchantu yathaivaṃ yatheṣṭaṃ bhuñjatha pibatha jighratha atikramatha mama sarvākāratayā satsukhavivṛddhaye sahāyikā bhavantu hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ phaṭ svāhā - ity anena vāradvayoccāritena ḍhaukayet | tadamṛtabhakṣaṇād dikpālādayo mahāsukhasamarpitavigrahā bhāvyāḥ | tadanu samudāyena tāmbūlādikaṃ dattvā svahṛdbījanirgatavīṇādibhiḥ saṃpūjyāṣṭapadamantreṇa saṃstutyābhimatasiddhaye prārthyacchomohastena saṃchobhya nyūnādikavidhipūraṇārthaṃ śatākṣaraṃ mantraṃ ghaṇṭāvādanapūrvakaṃ paṭhet |

tataḥ oṁ yogaśuddhāḥ sarvadharmā yogaśuddho 'ham iti paṭhan kamalāvartamudrayā paritoṣya mudropasaṃhāreṇāliṅganābhinayapūrvakaṃ vāmānāmikāṅguṣṭhachoṭikādānapūrvakaṃ oṃ vajra mur iti paṭhan visarjayet | cakram ātmani sarvākāreṇa praveśayet | tataḥ praṇidhānaṃ kṛtvā devatārūpeṇa vihared iti |

snānakāle 'bhiṣekavidhiṃ vidadhīta, bhojanakāle tu maṇḍalacakrātmakaṃ svadehaṃ jhaṭiti vicintya yathāvidhānaṃ baliṃ dattvā tryakṣareṇa balim adhiṣṭhāya oṃ kha [ed. p. 145] kha khāhi khāhītyādi mantreṇa ekavāroccāritena dikpālebhyo dattvā jvālanādividhinā śodhayitvā vidhivad bhakṣyādikaṃ sarvadharmatāsamatāhaṅkārapūrvakam oṃ samayaśuddhāḥ sarvadharmāḥ samayaśuddho 'ham iti sarvadharmasamatāhaṅkāreṇa hūṁkāraniṣpannāṃ śuklavajramayīṃ jihvāṃ vidhāya oṃ amṛtodaka hūṁ hūṁ ṭha ṭha trāṃ āḥ khaṁ hūṁ ity anenādhiṣṭhāya tryakṣareṇa nābhisthaṃ vaṃkāraṃ prīṇayed iti |

madhyāhnasandhyāyāṃ tu dhyānagṛhaṃ praviśya oṁ āḥ hūṁ oṁ sarvayoginīnāṃ kāyavākcittavjarasvabhāvātmako 'ham, oṁ vajraśuddhāḥ sarvadharmā vajraśuddho ham iti mantratrayam uccārayan jhaṭiti maṇḍalacakram adhimucya pūrvavat sarvaṃ kṛtvā yathāmsukhaṃ vihared iti |

ardharātrasandhyāyāṃ madhyāhnasandhyāvat sarvaṃ kṛtvā sarvavāgvyāpāram ālikālimayaṃ buddhvā akārādikṣakārāntaṃ huṁ hūṁ phaṭ phaṭ ity uccārya prabhāsvaram āmukhīkṛtya nidrāyāṃ ca prabhāsvaratām adhimuñcan śayīta | sarvāsu sandhyāsu paryante śatākṣaraṃ japet | punaḥ prabhātasandhyāyāṃ prabhāsvarotthitamaṇḍalacakram adhimucya pūrvoktasarvam anutiṣṭhed iti |

bāhye pūjāvidhir ucyate | iha bhagavatīṃ pūjayitukāmaḥ prātar utthāya yathāvasaraṃ vā vajravairocanīyogavān mantrī śucipradeśe hastaṃ dattvā oṁ sumbhani sumbhetyādimantram uccārya pañcāmṛtasugandhādivaṭikayā anyatamadravyamiśritagomayavaṭikayā caturasramaṇḍalam upalipya tanmadhye hastaṃ dattvā pūjetyādicaturviṃśatyakṣarāṇi pīṭhopapīṭhādidaśanāmāni ca tattadbhūmyadhimokṣapūrvakam uccārayet | tats tatra maṇḍalake jhaṭiti caturmahābhūtasthasumerūpari raktapadmasthasūryavaṃkāraṃ dṛṣṭvā tadraśmibhir jñānamaṇḍalam ānīya tatra praveśya tatpariṇatāṃ bhagavatīṃ saparivārāṃ sarvākāraniṣpannāṃ paśyet |

tataḥ svahṛdbījanirgatavīṇādidevībhiḥ saṃpūjya saptaratnādīni ca tannirgatādini ḍhaukayitvā yathāvidhi śodhitavāmakareṇa maṇḍalamadhye bhagavatyai tryakṣareṇa puṇyaṃ dadyāt | punas tatraiva bhagavatīhṛdayopahṛdayamantrābhyāṃ ḍhaukayet | tato ḍākinyādīnāṃ yamamathanīparyantānāṃ svasvamantreṇa dikṣu vāmāvartena vidiṣu dakṣiṇāvartena yathāsthānaṃ maṇḍalake puṇyaṃ deyam | tato vakṣyamāṇahastapūjākrameṇa karavinyastānāṃ devatānāṃ ca tattatsthāneṣu tattanmantreṇa oṁ ha ityādinā puṣpaṃ dadyāt | tatas tadvāmakaragatapuṣpam aṣṭapadamantroccāraṇapūvakaṃ maṇḍalake prakṣipya śirasāñjalikaraṇapūvakaṃ karatalagataṃ devatācakram ātmani praveśayet | tadanu hṛdayādyaṣṭapadamantrastutipūrvakaṃ yathāvartitastutibhiḥ saṃstutya yathāśakti pāpadeśanādikaṃ dhyānamantrajāpapraṇidhānādikaṃ ca vidhāya śatākṣaram uccārya oṁ yogaśuddhāḥ sarvadharmā yogaśuddho 'ham iti mantrasahitakamalāvartamudrayā saṃtoṣya mudropasaṃhāreṇāliṅganābhinayapuraḥsaraṃ choṭikādānasahitam oṁ vajra mur iti paṭhan visarjya taccakram ātmani praveśayet | tato maṇḍale rekhāṃ lumped iti jñātavyam | 

hastapūjāvidhir ucyate | tatra gaṇamaṇḍalādau śrīvajravārāhīyogavān yogī vāmakare buddhātarjanīmadhyamānāmikākaniṣṭhā tannakhamukheṣu vajrasattvavairocanāmitābhākṣobhyaratnasambhavāmoghasiddhisvarūpān yathākramaṃ śuklapītaraktakṛṣṇaharitavarṇān oṁ ha namaḥ hi svāhā hu vauṣaṭ he huṁ hūṁ hoḥ phaṭ haṃkāraṃ vinyaset | karatale jhaṭiti niṣpannāraktapañcadalakamalaṃ dhyātvā pūrvādidigdaleṣu vāmāvartena yathākramaṃ yāminī-mohinī-sañcāraṇī-saṃtrāsanī-caṇḍikāsvarūpāṇi [ed. p. 147, begins °dhūmra°] nīlaśvetapītaharitadhūmradhūsaravarṇāni haṃ yoṃ hriṃ moṃ hreṃ hiṃ huṁ hūṁ phaṭ phaṭ iti bījākṣarāṇi paśyet | karṇikāyāṃ vajravārāhīsvabhāvaṃ raktavarṇaṃ oṁ vaṁ iti bījam etatpratibimbaṃ tricakraṃ vā adhaḥ karapṛṣṭhe 'pi parisphuṭaṃ paśyet |

tataḥ karagatān pṛthivyaptejovāyvākāśadhātūn pātanī-māraṇī-ākarṣaṇī-narteśvarī-padmajālinīsvabhāvān adhimuñcet | tatas tatkaragatāni bījākṣarāṇi dravadravyeṇa mrakṣayitvā tatkaratalaṃ sarvayoginyadhiṣṭhitatricakrarūpam adhimuñcet | dravādidravyaṃ tryakṣaramantreṇāṣṭapadamantreṇa vā dadyāt | tataḥ saṃpūjya nyūnādhikavidhipūraṇārthaṃ śatākṣaraṃ paṭhitvā cakrādyadhiṣṭhānārthamadhyeṣya taddravam aparadravye 'nyatra vā sthāpayitvā hastalagnena dravyeṇa vāmānāmikāgṛhītena hṛjjihvāśirāṃsi hūṁ āḥ oṁkāroccāraṇapūrvakaṃ mrakṣayan taddevatāvṛndam ātmani praviṣṭam adhimuñcet | etat tu vidhānaṃ saṃcāratantre prasiddham | [iti] hastapūjāvidhiḥ | 

yad vā pūrvoktavidhiśodhitavāmakarānāmikayā pīṭhopapīṭhādidaśanāmāny uccārayan yathāvidhiśodhitamadanena trikoṇacakradvayapuṭam abhilekhya tanmadhye vartulamaṇḍalaṃ tatra svahṛdbījanirgatāṃ tatkiraṇākṛṣṭāṃ sādhārādheyacakrāṃ bhagavatīṃ vicintya tasyai pañcāmṛtādirūpeṇa niṣpāditaṃ khādyapeyādikaṃ tryakṣareṇāṣṭapadamantreṇa vā dattvā padmabhājanagatam amṛtāyitaṃ madanaṃ vṛddhānāmikābhyāṃ gṛhītvā bhagavatīṃ svahṛdayopahṛdayābhyāṃ ḍākinyādiyamamathanīparyantāś ca yathāsvam etāsām eva mantraiḥ saṃtarpayet | tataḥ saṃpūjya nyūnātirekavidhipūraṇārthaṃ śatākṣaraṃ paṭhitvā gaṇacakrādhiṣṭhānārthaṃ [ed. p. 148] cādhyeṣya oṁ yogaśuddhāḥ sarvadharmā yogaśuddho 'ham iti paṭhan kamalāvrtenamudrayā saṃtoṣya tanmudropasaṃhāra āliṅganābhinayapūrvakam anāmikayā bhūmiṃ spṛśan oṁ vajra mur iti paṭhitvā visarjya taccakram ātmani praveśayet | tatas tatra bhūmigatamadanaṃ vāmānāmikayā gṛhītvā tena hṛjjihvāśirāṃsi hūṁ āḥ oṁkāroccāraṇapūrvakaṃ mrakṣayan tatkaragatam api devatācakram ātmani praviṣṭam ālokayed iti hastena pūjoktā | tataḥ oṁ śukla oṁ kārapariṇatavajrajihvādakṣiṇastruveṇetarāhutiṃ svanābhikamalakarṇikāyām avasthitajvālāmālākulamaṇḍaleṣu juhuyāt | ity adhyātmahomaśeṣaḥ |

oṁ āḥ ucchiṣṭavajra adhitiṣṭhemaṃ baliṃ hūṁ svāhā | śūnyatākaruṇādvaye traidhātukacakrākārajñānavahnau tu yathopadeśaṃ skandhādīn dhanadahanān niruttarahomaḥ | śāntikapauṣtikādibāhyahomas tu homavidhau karmānurūpavihitakuṇḍakusumasamidhaśoṣaṇādikam anusṛtya [kāryaḥ] | vidhayo vistarabhayān na likhitāḥ | evaṃ tāvat pūjābalividhānādisametaṃ vistareṇa bhagavatyā bhāvanāmaṇḍalaṃ nirdiṣṭam |

madhyarucis tu digdaleṣu ḍākinyādaś catasraḥ, vidigdaleṣu padmabhāṇḍasthasamayadravyāṇi, madhye yathānirdiṣṭā bhagavatīti pañcātmakaṃ maṇḍalaṃ bhāvayed iti | balipūjādikaṃ tu yathāyogaṃ svasvamantraiḥ pañcānāṃ kartavyam | rakṣācarkādiaṃ pūvavad eva | oḍiyānavinirgatakrameṇa punar iyam ūrdhvapādā bhavati | niṣpattibījaṃ hṛdayādimantrāsta eva | ḍākinyādayo 'pi tathaiva |

saṃkṣiptārthī tu yathoktarūpāṃ bhagavatīm eva kevalāṃ bhāvayati | pūjādikaṃ yathoktaṃ bhagavatyā vidheyam | kvacid iyaṃ svahṛccandrasthasitaoṁkāraraśmibhir [ed. p. 149 - began °r] ānītabuddhādīn pūjayitvā yāvacchūnyatāṃ vibhāvya candravajrasya vaṃbījaniṣpannā padmacandrāsanā bhāvyate |

kiñceyam eva bhagavatī vajravairocanī vajrayoginīty ucyate | asyāś ca yathāgamaṃ yathopadeśaṃ bahuprakārā āmnāyabhedāḥ | tad yathā — svanābhistharaṃbhavatrikoṇāgnimaṇḍalopari raktavartulāravindaraktahrīṃkāraṃ dṛṣtvā tatsarvapariṇāmena raktavarṇām ālīḍhapadākrāntaśavāṃ mūrdhni piṅgalakeśāṃ caturbhujāṃ dakṣiṇābhyāṃ vajrāṅkuśau vāmābhyāṃ khaṭvāṅgakapālau tarjanīpāśau ca dhārayantīṃ bṛhadudarāṃ kolāsyāṃ bhagavatīm ātmānaṃ bhāvayet | pariśiṣṭarūpāṃ pūrvavad iti śrīvajraghoṇā kramaḥ | 

viśeṣas tu — oṁ hū hriṃ traṁ iti hṛdayam | oṁ vajravārāhī āveśaya sarvaduṣṭān hrīṁ svāhā [iti] upahṛdayam | devīyogapuraḥsaram etallakṣaṇaṃ jāpāt siddhyati na saṃśayaḥ | oṁ āḥ hrīṁ hūṃ haḥ haḥ anena mantreṇa mahāmāṃsacūrṇena dhūpaṃ dadyāt | paṭāgrata ekaviṃśatidinair abhimataṃ siddhyati | oṁ hrīṃ haṃ hāṃ haḥ haḥ hiḥ hīṃḥ (?) hīṃḥ hīṃḥ pheṃ pheṃkāraṃ dadyāt | sarvamārapraśamanārthaṃ niśāvaliḥ pañcopacāreṇa dātavyā | abhivyeṣu na prakāśanīyo 'yaṃ vidhiḥ | tena vajrayoginyo 'dhitiṣṭhanti | oṁ hrīṃ ghātaya sarvaduṣṭān hūṁ phaṭ svāhā | anena prathamato baliṃ dattvā vajraghoṇāsādhanam idam anuṣṭheyam | prāg uktam api balividhānādikam atra kriyate | adhikaṃ hi praśasyeta iti | 

kvacid iyaṃ hṛdraktapadme āṃkārajasūryasthasitahrīkārādhiṣṭhitāruṇapañcaśūkavajrapariṇatā, sitalohitapadmasthasūryasaptājñānapuruṣopari [ed. p. 150, begins padasthitā] ālīḍhapadasthitā, sūryastharaktahrīṃkārādhiṣṭhitasūryasthavajrahṛdayā, viśvapadmasūryasthākṣobhyābhiṣekajā | aparaṃ sarvaṃ pūrvavat |

tadanu nābhau viśvapadmasthāruṇaśubhrasūryamaṇḍale hrīḥkāraṃ dṛṣtvā tanmantramālām akṣasūtrākārāṃ sitāṃ cakrabhramaṇayogena vadanavivareṇa niścārya buddhaguṇagaṇamaṇimantrauṣadhicandratārālipiśāstrakalādiprabhāvam ādāya nābhivivare praviśantīṃ svapareṣāṃ sarvājñānadahanātmikāṃ dhāyāt | drutādidoṣarahitaṃ mantraṃ japet | mantraḥ hrīṃ hrīṃ | yadotthātukāmo bhavati, tadā mantramālāṃ nābhisthahrīṃkāre 'ntarbhāvya pūjādikaṃ kṛtvā yathāsukhaṃ viharet | kiñca āḥkārajasarojadalābhasvajihvāyāṃ raktahrīṃkāraṃ jvaladbhāsvararūpaṃ vibhāvya tatra cittaṃ sthirīkṛtya śatārdhagulikāmālām akṣasūtreṇa catuḥsandhyaṃ trisandhyaṃ vā japet |

evaṃ japabhāvanānvito yogī saptalakṣajāpena sarvaśāstrakalābhijño medhāvī sugrāhī gaṇānabhibhavanīyo vādī mahākaviś ca bhavati | jvaralūtāḍākinyādibhiḥ śoṣadroyitum aśakyaḥ | siddhe saty asmin mantre etanmantrābhimantritā kaṭhinī yasya haste dīyate, sa mūrkho 'pi kavir bhavati | vaśye tv enāṃ raktavarṇāṃ vibhāvya vidhivad amṛtasvādaṃ kṛtvā svanāmākṣaraniṣpannaṃ sādhyaṃ mantramālānirgataraśmibhir ākṛṣyānītaṃ purovartitaṃ dṛṣtvā cittam oḥkārapariṇataraktacandramaṇḍalākāram avalokya tanmantramālānirgatāṃ devīṃ raktavarṇāṃ vāmakareṇa hrīḥkārajapāśadharāṃ dakṣiṇe raktotpalakalikānibhavajrāṅkuśadharāṃ sādhyapurovartinīṃ paśyet | tataḥ oṁ āḥ hrīḥ amukasya [ed. p. 151] cittam ākarṣaya hūṁ jaḥ ity ājñād ānānantaraṃ sā devī vidhivat sādhyadehasyāntaḥ praviśya cittacandramaṇḍalaṃ pāśena saṃveṣṭya aṅkuśena codayantī svacitte praveśya mantramālāyām antarbhavet | tatas taṃ sādhyaṃ kṛtakarapuṭam ekāntaṃ paravaśaṃ sādhakābhimukhaṃ kiṃ karomīti vadantaṃ dhyāyād iti | evaṃ catuḥsandhyaṃ trisandhyaṃ vā dhyāyed acirāt sādhyam avaśyaṃ vaśayatīti |

kvacit punar iyaṃ viśvapadmacandrastharaktahūṁkārapariṇatālīḍhapratyālīḍhapadākrāntaśavā ūrdhvajvalitaraktakeśā dvibhujā dakṣiṇena kartitarjanīkā vāmena raktapūrṇakapāladharā śeṣālaṅkārādikaṃ pūrvavat | oṁ sarvabuddhaḍākinīye oṁ vajravarṇanīye oṁ vajravairocanīye hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ phaṭ phaṭ svāhā | mūlamantraḥ | oṁ vajraḍākinīye hrūṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā | hṛdayamantraḥ | oṁ vajrayoginīye hūṁ phaṭ svāhā | upahṛdayamantraḥ | oṁ vajraḍākinīye imaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa ha ha ha ha ha kha kha kha kha a a a a mama siddhiṃ prayaccha hūṁ phaṭ svāhā | anena mantreṇa pūrvavad amṛtīkṛtya balir deyaḥ | viśeṣatvenāṣṭamyādau niśi śmaśāne dātavyaḥ | kvacid iyaṃ raktahūṁkārajātā muktakuntalakalāpā dṛśyate, kvacic chavarahitā | adhimantrās tu ta eva |

kvacit svanābhisthaśuklakamalasūryasthitasindūrāruṇadharmodayāmadhye pītahrīḥkārajā svayamm eva kartitasvamastakaṃ vāmahastasthitaṃ dhārayantī, dakṣiṇena karti, urdhvavistṛtavāmabāhuḥ, adhonamitadakṣiṇabāhuḥ, prasāritadakṣiṇapādā, saṃkucitavāmacaraṇā | kabandhād avadhūtovartmanā niḥsṛtyāsṛgdhārā tasyā mukhe patati, apare lalanārasanābhyāṃ niḥsṛtya pārśvayoginyor mukhe praviśata iti bhāvya tatra vāmapārśve śyāmavarṇā vajravarṇanī vāmena karti dakṣiṇena kapālaṃ bibhrāṇā [ed. p. 152, begins °vāmapādā] prasāritavāmapādā | dakṣiṇapārśve pītavarṇā vajravairocanī dakṣiṇena karti vāmena kapālaṃ bibhratī prasāritadakṣiṇacaraṇā saṃkucitavāmacaraṇā | aparaṃ pūrvavat | oṁ sarvabuddhaḍākinīye oṁ vajravarṇanīye oṁ vajravairocanīye hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ phaṭ phaṭ svāhā | jāpamantraḥ |

pūjocyate — caturasramaṇḍalasthasūryasyopari dharmodayāṃ likhitvā tanmadhye hrīṃkāraṃ ca vicintya pūjayet | tatra dharmodayāmadhye oṁ sarvabuddhaḍākinīye ityādimantreṇa prathamam arcayet | oṁ sarvabuddhaḍākinīye hūṁ svāhā, ity anenārghādikaṃ dadyāt | vāme oṁ vajravarṇanīye hūṁ svāhā | dakṣiṇe oṁ vajravairocanīye hūṁ svāhā iti pūjayet | tata oḍiyāṇapūrṇagirikāmarūpaśrīhaṭṭadharmasaṃbhoganirṇmāṇamahāsukhakāyānāṃ pratyekaṃ caturthyantaṃ nāma vidarbhya oṁ kārādisvāhāntena pūjayitvā pūrvavat visarjayed iti | karmāntare tv iyaṃ svadehatraidhātukaviśuddhaṃ kūṭāgāram adhimucyet | jhaṭiti nābhimaṇḍale dvijā kartikapālahastā ardhaparyaṅkā kṛtatāṇḍavā javākusumasannibhā bhāvanīyā |

	kolāsyaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ tasyāḥ krodhāsyaṃ vāmam eva ca |
	satyadvayaviśuddhyā tu vaktradvayam udāhṛtam || iti |

tad evam ādāya siddhopadeśaparamparāyātā vineyāśayabhedādanantā bhagavtyā āmnāyā boddhavyāḥ | diṅmātram idaṃ darśitam | eṣu ca krameṣu kramam ekam ādāya śraddhādayāvān niḥsaṅgaḥ samayasevī nirvicikitsaṃ bhāvayan niyamena sādhayati |

upadeśāgatā pūrvapūjā likhyate | daśamyāṃ kuṅkumādim ārjite nirmalabhājena sindūraṃ pātayitvā tanmadhye suvarṇalekhanyā dharmodayām abhilikhya tanmadhye [ed. p. 153] hrīṃkāraṃ likhet | tataḥ pārśvato nandyāvartamudrāṃ likhitvā jalakusumair arcayet | oḍiyānaprabhṛtipīṭhacatuṣṭayaṃ kāyacatuṣṭayaṃ ca pūrvavat pūjayet | bhakṣyapeyādikaṃ samayadravyaṃ ca yathālābhaṃ nivedayet | kumārīṃ ca pūjayet | ayaṃ ca vidhir nagnena muktakuntalena dakṣiṇābhimukham upaviśya suguptam anuṣṭheyaḥ | anyathā siddhihānir nānāvidhāś ca rogā jāyante | tato baliṃ dattvā abhimatasiddhiprārthanāṃ kṛtvā visarjya sindūranaivedyādikaṃ kumārikāṇām avidhavāstrīṇāṃ vā dadyāt | kiñca daśamyām aṣṭamyāṃ caturdaśyāṃ vā yatkiñit (yakiñcit ED) puṣpaphalatailatāmbūlataṇḍulaśākaparṇadadhikāṣṭhalavaṇasindūramatsyamāṃsaṃ māmakīprabhṛtiyoṣijjanena vikrīyate, tataḥ kiñcid yatkiñcit yathāśakti krītvā yathāyogaṃ prasādhya pūrvavat sindūranirmitadharmodayāṃ bījākṣarādikaṃ likhitvā sampūjya samīhitasiddhiṃ prārthya visarjayet |

ataḥ paraṃ pūrvavat svapne vajrayoṣitām āśvāso bhavatīty upadeśataḥ | api cātyantanirmṛṣṭadarpaṇatale 'ṣṭamyāṃ sindūraṃ pātayitvā tatra dharmodayamudrāṃ likhitvā koṇeṣu bāhyeṣu vaṃbījaṃ vilikhya madhye mantraṃ ca, dharmodayābāhyeṣu catuḥpārśveṣu vāmāvartena nandyāvartaṃ likhitvā puṣpādibhiḥ saṃpūjya yathāśakti mantraṃ parijapya japasindūraṃ tad ekatra bhāṇḍe sthāpayet | evaṃ ṣaṇmāsaṃ yāvat kuryāt | tato lāṅgaliye viṣanalikāmadhye tat sindūraṃ prakṣipya śmaśāne nikhanet | baliṃ pūjāṃ ca vidhāya mantraṃ japed yathākāmam | evaṃ pratyahaṃ māsam ekaṃ kuryāt | tatsindūreṇa nandyāvartākṛtitilakaṃ vidhāya bhikṣārthaṃ grāmaṃ praviśet | yatra tat tilakaṃ saṃkrāntaṃ dṛśyate tāṃ strīṃ yatnenārādhayed iti | evaṃ nandyāvartena siddhaśabarapādīyavajrayoginyārādhanavidhiḥ |

[ed. p. 154] atra ca yoginīnaye sthitena pūjāmantrajapabhojanādikaṃ guptyā vāmena karaṇiyam | pīṭhādiyātrāṃ kurvatāṃ vajraḍākinīr uddiśya grāmanagarādau pradakṣiṇaṃ vāmāvartena kartavyam | gacchatāṃ prathamaṃ vāmapādaṃ puraḥ prasārya gantavyam | yathāmilitāḥ pañcakāmā vairocanādiviśuddhyā nirvicikitsam upabhoktavyāḥ | suśīlānaparādhayor abhicārakarma na kartavyam | yoṣito na tāḍayitavyāḥ, na kroddhavyāḥ, na cāvamantavyāḥ, viśeṣeṇa ṣaṇmudrādhāriṇya iti bahuprakārāḥ samayās tantrānusāreṇa buddhvā paripālanīyāḥ | mantrādayo 'pi tata evāvagamya prayoktavyaḥ | vistarabhayān na likhitāḥ | kiṃ bahunā — 

	gurur buddho burur dharmo guruḥ saṃghas tathaiva ca |
	gurur vajradharaḥ śrīmān gurur evātra kāraṇam ||
	gurumārādhayet tasmād buddhatvaphalavāñcayā || iti

vidhāyedaṃ triśvaṃ guṇakusumasammodasubhagaṃ 
samīhante bhoktuṃ yadi jhaṭiti santaḥ śamaphalam |
tadopeyur yatnād abhisamayakalpadrumabhavāṃ 
navāmunmīlantīmatirasavatīṃ mañjarim imām ||

tantrābhisamayopāsasādhanebhyo guror api |
vacanāt kiñcid ākṛṣya nirmiteyam anuākulā ||

yanmayāsāditaṃ puṇyam etan nirmāṇasambhavam |
anena bhajatām uccair jagad vajrāṅganāpadam ||

śrīvajrayoginīsādhanam abhisamayamañjarīnāma mahācāryaśubhākaraguptaracitaṃ samāptam ||
